  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Introduction of Aquaponics and Hydroponics in support of Effective use of water</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will establish units for simple hydroponics and aquaponics in one of the agricultural stations in MoA while building the theoretical and practical capacities for the targeted trainees through supporting MoA extension services to adopt the technologies of hydroponics and aquaponics</narrative>
